  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">About our brand and products:</span></strong></p><ul><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">VOYAGE Comics is the largest Catholic comic book company in the world, creating high-quality comics rooted in truth, beauty, and goodness.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Our titles span multiple genres, including saints, superheroes, fantasy, and adventure stories for readers of all ages.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Every comic is created with traditional family values in mind and is designed to inspire, entertain, and uplift readers.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">All current VOYAGE comic titles have received a <em>Nihil Obstat</em> and <em>Imprimatur</em>, confirming they are free from theological error after review by the local bishop and diocese.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Faithfully Catholic storytelling infused with authentic Catholic values and theology.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Comics reviewed and approved through official Church theological review processes.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Professional-quality artwork and storytelling that rivals mainstream entertainment.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Led by experienced creators with backgrounds working for major publishers including MARVEL, DC Comics, Ascension Press, TAN Books, and Our Sunday Visitor.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Stories created specifically to provide exciting, family-friendly alternatives to overly sexualized or morally compromised mainstream comics.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Earn commission on every qualified sale generated through your affiliate link.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Promote bestselling titles, new releases, bundles, and seasonal campaigns.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Benefit from a growing audience of Catholic families, educators, homeschoolers, youth groups, and comic fans seeking wholesome entertainment.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Opportunities for recurring promotions tied to launches, holidays, and special events.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Share your affiliate links through blogs, YouTube channels, podcasts, newsletters, and social media.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Recommend comics to Catholic schools, parishes, homeschool groups, and youth ministries.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Create reviews, unboxings, reading lists, or family-friendly entertainment recommendations.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Highlight the theological approval, family values, and mainstream-level artwork as key differentiators.</li><li style=\"color:rgb(41,105,176);\">Feature comics during liturgical seasons, feast days, comic conventions, or faith-based events.</li></ul><p><br></p></div>",
